	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Salutem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Praesentium lator, <placeName ref="l210">Heidelbergensis</placeName> ecclesię <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>hactenus diaconus, a suo principe electore nuper dimissus <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>propter congressum cum superbo veritatis oppugnatore, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>eiusdem ecclesię pastore ac doctore, mihi a d. <persName ref="p8468">Xilandro</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>academię <placeName ref="l210">Heidelbergensis</placeName> professore, commendatus est.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Quem etiam tibi ac symmystis tuis commendatum esse <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>cupio.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Ipse vobis totam hanc sui discessus causam <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>enarrabit, que tam est incolumis, ut spes sit illustrissimum <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>principem nequaquam dimissurum fuisse eum, nisi alieno <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>tempore gliscens dissidium turbas ipsi aliquas daturum <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>veritus esset.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Audies ab eo bona fide, quo tandem <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>amentię et caecitatis ruant miseri illi vere sacramentarii, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>ut fere tolerabilior sit pontificiorum de sacris mysteriis <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>sententia quam illorum.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Vereor autem bonum et <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>doctum virum difficulter, ut nunc se res habent, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>posse restitui ecclesię illi, nisi dominus aperiat principum <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>oculos aut docti illi, quorum ubique bona pars, tandem <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>exuant metum illum humanum, qui hactenus o quam <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>multos detinet non sine gravi conscientiarum vulnere, <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>quo minus testimonium ferant agnitę veritati.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Oremus <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>ergo dominum sedulo, ut tandem respiciat ecclesiam <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>suam ac tollat e medio scandalum illud.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Amen.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Quem nuper librum miseras, pro eo tibi gratias ago; <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>alterum d. d. <persName>Thomę</persName> <placeName ref="l101">Colmariam</placeName> misi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Dess tuͦchs halb by der Meisin hab ich gearbeitet, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>damitt die von <placeName ref="l404">Rapolstein</placeName> selbs schribe; weiß <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>aber nitt, ob es bscheihen ist oder nitt.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Bene vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/><placeName ref="l28">Basilee</placeName> 19. octobris 1559.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/>Tuus totus <persName ref="p1754">Ioannes Iung</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>domino <persName ref="p495">Henrico Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>fratri suo venerando <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>ac longe charissimo.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
